{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80a5ba49b1a90b0aa25f0e70ceb447990d45bf635636cd8e444c673ec4ffe6ce",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765a387a6cac7063e13b80b0156198f9cff06aeb9bfaf0933f909f9a983a5ab7",
      "text": "（…明明一开始帮父亲写小说，\n只是想让他高兴而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:567565fc2948462b3601a8b02648b765a57497c79b5fbe833a9aaa36ddae97be",
      "text": "（…随着那部小说受到社会的评价，\n我们之间的关系也变得不正常了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b4d8d315f97f92d5c79a59319817c55fc2ad3d14fc75b8ba730483428192fba",
      "text": "（…恐怕父亲，比我更早察觉，\n也为此苦恼着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a21f0bee0467693d358885719af3f05510da945beffc7c28eeea0db085927bcc",
      "text": "（…察觉到影子写手的存在，这个秘密，\n对任何人都没有好处……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d79630dbd40a26e0d6f1531a83cab29cdebe3de592aaf78f054ab184aebf5a",
      "text": "（…我也该更早注意到的。\n契机明明多得是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b6da69e3171e6447845454d35b67440fab7acff05f60c1fb9285987cea49b5",
      "text": "（…在父亲的态度变得冷漠的时候。\n甚至到了最后，连眼神都不再对上的时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f4328f0b2be0dc6079fd1d629f92dfc9f3b949f7c2af67e091e827b669b6a3",
      "text": "…无论怎么后悔，都已经太迟了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933eb6f87e17b08e5d2fa89b5be230341981ba7d55d6c581256f0ad5e3bbf156",
      "text": "（…不该是这样的。\n我只是，想看到父亲的笑容而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edecb655fc5ed51274056e02798d0a660c70ffd41d0863c41c6a95a493e61f99",
      "text": "…笑容。\n最后一次看到父亲的笑容，是什么时候了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62c62fd9ef2600a0c583aae8fbfe9e51fd280255736f83903c4e86a158b71b6a",
      "text": "（…我已经想不起来了，父亲）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
